#: scheduler.cpp:370
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The event, to-do or journal to be updated could not be found. Maybe it has "
"already been deleted, or the calendar that contains it is disabled. Press "
"'Store' to create a new one or 'Throw away' to discard this update."
msgstr ""
"De Begeefnis-, Opgaav- oder Dagbookindrag, den Du opfrischen wullt, lett sik "
"nich finnen. Villicht hett Een em al wegdaan, oder de Kalenner, de em bargt, "
"is utmaakt. Klick op \"Sekern\", wenn Du em nieg opstellen wullt, oder op "
"\"Wegsmieten\", wenn Du de Opfrischen wegsmieten wullt."

#: scheduler.cpp:374
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Discard this update?"
msgstr "Disse Opfrischen wegsmieten?"

#: scheduler.cpp:375
msgctxt "@option"
msgid "Store"
msgstr "Sekern"

#: scheduler.cpp:376
msgctxt "@option"
msgid "Throw away"
msgstr "Wegsmieten"

#: scheduler.cpp:470
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The event or task could not be removed from your calendar. Maybe it has "
"already been deleted or is not owned by you. Or it might belong to a read-"
"only or disabled calendar."
msgstr ""
"De Begeefnis- oder Opgaavindrag lett sik nich ut Dien Kalenner wegmaken. "
"Villicht hett Een em al wegmaakt, oder villicht büst Du nich de Eegner. "
"Villicht höört he ok en bloots-leesbor oder utmaakt Kalenner to."

#: scheduler.cpp:507
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The event or task to be canceled could not be removed from your calendar. "
"Maybe it has already been deleted, or the calendar that contains it is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"De Begeefnis- oder Opgaavindrag, den Du afbreken wullt, lett sik nich ut "
"Dien Kalenner wegmaken. Villicht hett Een em al wegmaakt, oder de Kalenner, "
"de em bargt, is utmaakt."

